Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.20,0:04:48.50,Title,0,0,0,0,,《盲眼银行家》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:18.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,茶道中人曾语 茶壶经过多道茶的浸润\N{\fnArial\fs30}The great artisans say the more the teapot is used.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.20,0:00:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,将愈加温润如玉 焕然有光\N{\fnArial\fs30}the more beautiful it becomes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.60,0:00:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,养壶在于重复多次地用老茶汤汁浇壶身\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pot is seasoned by repeatedly pouring tea over the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.00,0:00:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶土吸入茶汤的沉淀\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deposit left on the clay.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,形成深厚温润的表面光泽\N{\fnArial\fs30}creates this beautiful patina over time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.70,0:00:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些茶壶焕发的典雅的幽光\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some pots, the clay has been burnished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.20,0:00:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是经四百年前的茶汤浸润而成\N{\fnArial\fs30}by tea made over 400 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.70,0:00:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆将在十分钟后关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}This museum will be closing in 10 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.10,0:00:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,四百年的古董 他们允许你用来泡茶喝呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}400 years old, they're letting you use it to make yourself a brew.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.40,0:01:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西注定不该空坐在玻璃护罩里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some things aren't supposed to sit behind glass,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.60,0:01:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,它们生来就该被人触碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're made to be touched.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.50,0:01:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,为人所用\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.30,0:01:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些茶壶需要关爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}These pots need attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.90,0:01:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,陶土有裂纹了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The clay is cracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.80,0:01:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不觉得浇一丁点儿茶汁 会有多大帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I can't see how a tiny splash of tea is going to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.10,0:01:19.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候一些东西需要你仔细地观察\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you have to look hard at something.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.90,0:01:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能品味其价值\N{\fnArial\fs30}to see its value.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:25.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到么\N{\fnArial\fs30}See?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.60,0:01:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一只的光泽稍微亮些\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one shines a little brighter.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.40,0:01:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.20,0:01:32.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, I mean…
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.10,0:01:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你愿意跟我出去喝点东西么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't suppose that you want to have a drink?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.80,0:01:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 不是喝茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not tea, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.40,0:01:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我去酒吧 喝一杯 今晚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, in a pub, with me, tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会那么喜欢我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't like me all that much.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.60,0:01:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,喜不喜欢由我自己决定的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I maybe decide that for myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.60,0:01:53.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.80,0:01:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.60,0:01:58.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请别再尝试约我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please stop asking.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.90,0:02:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是保安么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that security?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:44.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.20,0:03:22.20,Title,0,0,0,0,,《神探夏洛克》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.20,0:03:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,请工作人员速至收银机…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can the till supervisor please go to…?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.70,0:03:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,包装区域出现不明货物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Unexpected item in bagging area.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.10,0:03:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请重试\N{\fnArial\fs30}please try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.50,0:04:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,商品未扫描 请重试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Item not scanned. Please try again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.00,0:04:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能小点声吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you maybe keep your voice down?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.60,0:04:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 额度不足 信用卡授权失败 - 好吧 我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Card not authorised. - Yes, all right! I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,请使用其它付款方式 额度不足 信用卡授权失败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please use an alternative method of payment. Card not authorised.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.80,0:04:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,请使用其它付款方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please use an alternative method of payment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.40,0:04:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,自己留着吧 老子不买了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep it. Keep that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.90,0:04:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你出去好久 - 是啊 但我啥都没买成\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You took your time. - Yeah, I didn't get the shopping.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.80,0:04:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.90,0:05:01.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我在商店里跟自动收银机吵了一架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I had a row in the shop with a chip and PIN machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.60,0:05:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你跟台机器吵了一架？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You… You had a row with a machine?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.00,0:05:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多 它不动弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sort of. It sat there.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.20,0:05:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我朝它叫骂 你有现金么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I shouted abuse. Have you got cash?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.20,0:05:08.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的卡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.90,0:05:13.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该自己去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could always go yourself, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.30,0:05:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这坐了一上午\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've been sitting there all morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.40,0:05:16.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我出门这么长时间 你就没挪过窝\N{\fnArial\fs30}you've not even moved since I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.30,0:05:20.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次找你办的那个案子呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what happened about that case you were offered…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.00,0:05:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 切里亚的钻石？- 没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the Jharia diamond? - Not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.20,0:05:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给过他们答复了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent them a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.10,0:05:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不劳您大驾 我能提得动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry about me, I can manage.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.40,0:05:54.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你用的是我的电脑？- 当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that my computer? - Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.80,0:05:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 我的在卧室呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Mine was in the bedroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.80,0:05:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 就这么两步你都懒得走么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? And you couldn't be bothered to get up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.70,0:06:01.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我设了开机密码的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's password protected.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.10,0:06:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不妨说 我一分钟内就猜到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a manner of speaking. Took me less than a minute to guess yours,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是什么碉堡嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}not exactly Fort Knox.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.60,0:06:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 还来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.80,0:06:23.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 得找个工作了 - 没劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Need to get a job. - Oh, dull.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.00,0:06:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.60,0:06:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你能借我点儿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}…if you'd be able to lend me some…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.30,0:06:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 你在听我说话么 - 我得去趟银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock, are you listening? - I need to go to the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.30,0:07:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对了 你所谓去银行…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, when you said we were going to the bank…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.20,0:07:28.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.50,0:07:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 塞巴斯汀 - 好啊 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sebastian. - Hiya, buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.50,0:07:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好久不见了 算算该有八年了吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long… eight years since I last clapped eyes on you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.40,0:07:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我朋友 约翰·华生\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is my friend, John Watson.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.70,0:07:40.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 朋友？- 同事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Friend? - Colleague.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.10,0:07:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.40,0:07:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便坐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grab a pew.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,喝点什么 咖啡还是水？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you need anything, coffee, water?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.50,0:07:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不需要么 - 我们不渴 谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No? - We're all sorted here, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.80,0:07:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你过得挺滋润啊 经常出国\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're doing well. You've been abroad a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.30,0:07:56.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.80,0:07:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,全球飞来飞去 一个月内两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flying all the way around the world twice in a month.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.40,0:08:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈 我看出来了 你又来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. You're doing that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.50,0:08:07.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是大学同学 这家伙总耍这种鬼把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were at uni together, and this guy here had a trick he used to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.40,0:08:08.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,才不是什么鬼把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他看你一眼 就知道你的生平\N{\fnArial\fs30}He could look at you and tell you your whole life story.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.60,0:08:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我见识过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I've seen him do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.50,0:08:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,搞得人人自危 讨嫌的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put the wind up everybody, we hated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.60,0:08:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去学院宴会厅吃早餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd come down to breakfast in the formal hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.00,0:08:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这混蛋就一针见血地指出 你前一天鬼混了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this freak would know you'd been shagging the previous night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.20,0:08:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我只是观察细节 - 请指教吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I simply observed. - Go on, enlighten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.20,0:08:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,每月出差两回 满世界飞 全说中了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two trips a month, flying all the way around the world, you're quite right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.70,0:08:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么看出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,别告诉我 是我领带上溅了一滴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to tell me there's a stain on my tie.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:30.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么曼哈顿产的特制番茄酱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}from some special kind of ketchup you can only buy in Manhattan?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.90,0:08:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我… - 那是我鞋上的泥点？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I… - Is it the mud on my shoes?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.50,0:08:37.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚才在外面跟你秘书聊了会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just chatting with your secretary outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.40,0:08:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她告诉我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She told me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能赶来我太荣幸了 有人非法闯入银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you could make it over, we've had a break-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.90,0:08:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,威廉爵士的办公室 他曾是行长\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sir William's office, the bank's former chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.60,0:08:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,为表纪念 银行保留了他的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}The room's been left here like a sort of memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚有人闯入\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone broke in late last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.50,0:08:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 偷了什么？- 房间里什么都没少\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What did they steal? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.20,0:09:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅留了一条讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just left a little message.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.10,0:09:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,六十秒内出现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}60 seconds apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.60,0:09:28.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人在午夜闯进这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, someone came up here in the middle of the night,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.70,0:09:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,挥洒颜料 一分钟内又离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}splashed paint around and left within a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.40,0:09:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多少种方法进那个办公室？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many ways into that office?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.00,0:09:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵 这就是有意思的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's where this gets really interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.40,0:09:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行内部每扇门 都由这台电脑上锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every door that opens in this bank, it gets locked right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.20,0:09:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个步入式柜台 每个洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every walk-in cupboard, every toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.40,0:09:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个门昨晚没有开过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}That door didn't open last night?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.90,0:09:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们保安系统有漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a hole in our security.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能找到的话 我们付你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find it and we'll pay you…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,五位数\N{\fnArial\fs30}five figures.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.10,0:09:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是预付款\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is an advance.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.00,0:09:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,告诉我他怎么进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me how he got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.50,0:09:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,更大的数额在后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a bigger one on its way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.60,0:09:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不需要金钱激励 塞巴斯汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't need an incentive, Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.90,0:10:02.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他 咳咳 他是在开玩笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's, er… …he's kidding you, obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.50,0:10:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时由我帮他保管吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shall I look after that for him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.30,0:10:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.10,0:11:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个月出国两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two trips around the world this month.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.10,0:11:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没有问过他的秘书\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't ask his secretary,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.50,0:12:01.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那么说 就是想故意惹恼他罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you said that just to irritate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.40,0:12:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道的 - 注意到他的手表了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How did you know? - Did you see his watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.40,0:12:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的表怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His watch?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,时间是对的 但日期不对\N{\fnArial\fs30}The time was right, but the date was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.10,0:12:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,日期是两天以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Said two days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.50,0:12:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他穿越日界线两次了 还没调回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crossed the date line twice and he didn't alter it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.90,0:12:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月内怎么看出来的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Within a month? How did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.40,0:12:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,新款百年灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Breitling.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.40,0:12:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,今年二月刚刚上市的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only came out this February.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.70,0:12:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你觉得我们还需要在这继续查么\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK. So do you think we should sniff around here for a bit longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.10,0:12:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的线索齐了 多谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got everything I need to know already, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.10,0:12:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那涂鸦是个讯息\N{\fnArial\fs30}That graffiti was a message.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.80,0:12:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,给银行交易大厅某个员工的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone at the bank, working on the trading floors.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.20,0:12:27.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要找到讯息接收方\N{\fnArial\fs30}We find the intended recipient and…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.60,0:12:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,就能牵出留讯息的人了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll lead us to the person who sent it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.20,0:12:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.40,0:12:32.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,交易大厅里有三百名工作人员 该从何找起呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, there's 300 people up there, who was it meant for?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.50,0:12:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 柱子 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Pillars. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.30,0:12:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,柱子和屏幕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pillars and the screens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.40,0:12:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少有地方能看到那涂鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very few places you could see that graffiti from.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.60,0:12:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,范围大大缩小了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That narrows the field considerably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.60,0:12:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 讯息是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}And, of course, the message was left.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.70,0:12:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨晚11点34分留下的 这能说明很多事\N{\fnArial\fs30}at 11.34 last night. That tells us a lot.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.50,0:12:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.20,0:12:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,每小时都有人轮班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traders come to work at all hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.40,0:12:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些同香港的交易得半夜进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some trade with Hong Kong in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.30,0:12:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那条讯息是给半夜里来的人看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That message was intended for somebody who came in at midnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.60,0:12:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄页上姓凡·库的人不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not many Van Coons in the phone book.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.40,0:12:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.70,0:13:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在怎么办 在这儿呆坐着等他回来么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what do we do now? Sit here and wait for him to come back?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.80,0:13:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 刚搬进来 - 啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just moved in. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.30,0:13:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,楼上这家 名牌是新的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Floor above, new label.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.20,0:13:24.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也可能是刚换\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have just replaced it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.60,0:13:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没人那么无聊 - 哪位？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No-one ever does that. - Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.80,0:13:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我住你家楼下 我们应该还没见过面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, um, I live in the flat just below you. I don't think we've met.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.60,0:13:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 呃 我才刚搬进来没几天\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, well, er, I've just moved in.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是这样 我忘记带钥匙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I've just locked my keys in my flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:43.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我放你进来吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to buzz you in?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.30,0:13:45.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 能顺便借用你家阳台吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. And can we use your balcony?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.60,0:13:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.20,0:14:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.60,0:14:31.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, are you OK?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.50,0:14:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 等你乐意了再给我开门吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, any time you feel like letting me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.40,0:14:56.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得会是破产吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think he'd lost a lot of money?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.20,0:14:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市小青年自杀挺常见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suicide is pretty common among City boys.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.20,0:15:00.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还不能确定就是自杀 - 得了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We don't know that it was suicide. - Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.50,0:15:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,门从里面锁死\N{\fnArial\fs30}The door was locked from the inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.70,0:15:03.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是爬阳台进来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you had to climb down the balcony.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.90,0:15:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,从待洗衣物看来他离开了三天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been away three days judging by the laundry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.90,0:15:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看箱子里 有些东西折的很整齐\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the case, there was something tightly packed inside it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.20,0:15:15.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 多谢 我信你就行了 - 不愿意了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. I'll take your word for it. - Problem?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.80,0:15:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我可没绝望到要去翻死人内裤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm not desperate to root around some bloke's dirty underwear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.20,0:15:21.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,银行里的涂鸦 意图何在呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those symbols at the bank, the graffiti, why were they put there?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.90,0:15:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 某种密码么 - 显而易见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Some sort of code? - Obviously.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.00,0:15:26.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要画？要交流的话 发电邮啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why were they painted? Want to communicate, why not use e-mail?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.50,0:15:27.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能他没有回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe he wasn't answering.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 你跟上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good, you follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.40,0:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.40,0:15:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪种讯息让大家唯恐避之不及？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a message would everyone try to avoid?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.40,0:15:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如今天早上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about this morning?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.20,0:15:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你盯着的那些信 - 你说账单？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Those letters you were looking at? - Bills?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.90,0:15:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他被威胁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. He was being threatened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.50,0:15:47.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少不是煤气公司\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by the Gas Board.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.70,0:15:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看能不能从杯子上提些指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}…see if we can get prints off this glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.00,0:15:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官 初次见面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sergeant, we haven't met.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.80,0:15:54.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我知道你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.10,0:15:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你最好别碰任何证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I would prefer it if you didn't tamper with any of the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.50,0:16:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我给雷斯垂德打过电话 他过来了么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}I phoned Lestrade. Is he on his way?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.40,0:16:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他很忙 这里由我负责\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's busy. I'm in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我不是什么警官 我是迪莫克探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's not Sergeant, it's Detective Inspector Dimmock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.80,0:16:14.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这显然是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're obviously looking at a suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.90,0:16:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这似乎是所有证据的唯一解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does seem the only explanation of all the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.50,0:16:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,错 这只是解释之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong, it's one possible explanation.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.40,0:16:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,支持部分证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}of some of the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.40,0:16:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有了中意的结论 但你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got a solution that you like, but you are choosing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.20,0:16:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,选择忽略了与之不符的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}to ignore anything you see that doesn't comply with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.40,0:16:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 比如？- 伤口在头部右侧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like? - Wound's on the right side of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.00,0:16:28.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以？- 凡·库是左撇子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And? - Van Coon was left-handed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.20,0:16:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,身体得有多柔韧啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requires quite a bit of contortion.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.20,0:16:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 左撇子？- 你竟然没注意到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Left-handed? - I'm amazed you didn't notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.20,0:16:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,看他家的摆设就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All you have to do is look around this flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.00,0:16:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡桌靠左\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee table on the left-hand side,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.30,0:16:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,咖啡杯手柄朝左\N{\fnArial\fs30}coffee mug handle pointing to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.90,0:16:39.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,电源插头常用左边 纸和笔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Power sockets, habitually used the ones on the left. Pen and paper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.50,0:16:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在电话左侧 用右手接电话 左手记录\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the left of the phone. Picked up with his right, took messages with his left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.10,0:16:44.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还要继续？- 不了 你已经说明了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- D'you want me to go on? - No, I think you've covered it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.40,0:16:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是继续吧 快说完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I might as well, I'm almost at the bottom of the list.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.00,0:16:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,面包板上刀和黄油\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's a knife on the breadboard with butter.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.60,0:16:48.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,放在刀刃右边\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the right side of the blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.80,0:16:50.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他用左手握刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}because he used it with his left. It's highly unlikely.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.60,0:16:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,左撇子很难对头部右侧开枪自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}that a left-handed man would shoot himself in the right of his head.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.40,0:16:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,结论 有人闯了进来杀害了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Conclusion, someone broke in here and murdered him…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.40,0:16:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才是所有证据的唯一结论\N{\fnArial\fs30}only explanation of all of the facts.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.20,0:16:57.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,那枪呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:17:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,他知道会有人来杀他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was waiting for the killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.10,0:17:02.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他被威胁过了 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He'd been threatened. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.60,0:17:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天在银行 警告了他一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Today at the bank, sort of a warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.40,0:17:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,袭击者进入时他开了一枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He fired a shot when his attacker came in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.60,0:17:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 子弹呢 - 从开着的窗户飞了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And the bullet? - Went through the open window.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.90,0:17:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.70,0:17:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这几率该有多小啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are the chances of that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.70,0:17:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,等着看弹道检测报告吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait until you get the ballistics report.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.70,0:17:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,致命的子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bullet in his brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.50,0:17:18.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是他枪里的 我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}wasn't fired from his gun, I guarantee it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.90,0:17:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的门从里反锁了 凶手怎么进来的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}If his door was locked from the inside, how did the killer get in?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.60,0:17:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 你终于问了个正确的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, you're finally asking the right questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.20,0:17:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他几乎是用叉子剪自己的头发\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's left trying to sort of cut his hair with a fork,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.90,0:17:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,也就是根本做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}which of course can never be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.00,0:17:40.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,涂鸦是用来威胁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was a threat, that's what the graffiti meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在开会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm kind of in a meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.20,0:17:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能先跟我秘书预约一下么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you make an appointment with my secretary?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.60,0:17:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得不能等了 抱歉 塞巴斯汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think this can wait. Sorry, Sebastian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.60,0:17:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的一位交易员 在你办公室工作的 被谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of your traders, someone who worked in your office, was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.40,0:17:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 凡·库\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Van Coon.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.10,0:17:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方正在他家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police are at his flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.50,0:17:56.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,被谋杀了？抱歉影响了大家的胃口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Killed?! Sorry to interfere with everyone's digestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.10,0:17:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要预约么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still want to make an appointment?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.20,0:18:00.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不九点跟苏格兰场警官约一下？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would maybe nine o'clock at Scotland Yard suit?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.80,0:18:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,哈罗公学 牛津大学 有为青年啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Harrow, Oxford…very bright guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.20,0:18:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,在亚洲工作过 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worked in Asia for a while, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.10,0:18:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让他负责香港账户？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You gave him the Hong Kong accounts?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.40,0:18:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,曾经一早上损失了五百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost 5 million in a single morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.00,0:18:19.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,一周内又赚回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}made it all back a week later.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.60,0:18:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪有着钢铁般的意志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nerves of steel, Eddie had.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谁会想杀他呢 - 人人都会树敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who'd want to kill him? - We all make enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.30,0:18:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,但不是人人都会被爆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't all end up with a bullet through your temple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.80,0:18:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 常人是不会 - 失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not usually. - Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.10,0:18:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,董事长的短信\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my chairman.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方找他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Police have been on to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.30,0:18:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 警方说是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently they're telling him it was a suicide.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.90,0:18:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们弄错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they've got it wrong,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.90,0:18:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞巴斯汀 他是被谋杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sebastian. He was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.70,0:18:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,恐怕警方不这么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'm afraid they don't see it like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.00,0:18:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 所以？- 所以我老板也不这么看\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So? - And neither does my boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.70,0:18:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了我雇你查什么的 别分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hired you to do a job. Don't get sidetracked.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.40,0:18:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然银行家都是铁石心肠的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought bankers were all supposed to be heartless bastards.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.30,0:19:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你跑一趟克里斯宾拍卖行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to get over to Crispians.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.10,0:19:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个明代成化年间的古董花瓶拍卖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two Ming vases up for auction, Chenghua.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.50,0:19:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能评估下么 - 应该素琳去啊 她才是专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will you appraise them? - Soo Lin should go, she's the expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.20,0:19:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,素琳辞职了 需要你帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soo Lin has resigned her job. I need you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.70,0:20:53.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就是临时工哦 - 嗯 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Just locum work. - No, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.80,0:20:58.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你… 其实以你的资历干这个浪费了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're, um… Well, you're a bit over-qualified.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.60,0:21:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 因为我急需用钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, I could always do with the money.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.30,0:21:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周有两位医师度假去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we've got two away on holiday this week.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.40,0:21:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有一位因为怀孕离职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one's just left to have a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你来说可能太平凡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might be a bit mundane for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.70,0:21:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不 有时候平凡点也是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, no, mundane is good, sometimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.40,0:21:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挺喜欢平凡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mundane works.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.50,0:21:20.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简历上说你曾经是个军人 - 军医\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It says here you were a soldier. - And a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.40,0:21:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还会别的技能么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.60,0:21:26.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,在学校学过单簧管\N{\fnArial\fs30}I learned the clarinet at school.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.20,0:21:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,呵呵 期待你的表演哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh…well, I'll look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.70,0:21:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说过了 你能给我递支笔么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said, could you pass me a pen?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.40,0:21:45.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 啥时候？- 大概一小时以前\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? When? - About an hour ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.80,0:21:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,根本没注意我已经出门了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't notice I'd gone out then?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.80,0:21:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去一家诊所面试了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went to see about a job at that surgery.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.40,0:21:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么样 - 棒极了 她很迷人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How was it? - Great. She's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.10,0:21:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.40,0:21:58.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}The job.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:21:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,她？\N{\fnArial\fs30}She?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.60,0:22:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.60,0:22:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,随便了 过来看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, have a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.60,0:22:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,「能穿墙的侵入者」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"The intruder who can walk through walls."
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.90,0:22:14.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天晚上的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happened last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.50,0:22:16.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一记者在家中遭枪击身亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Journalist shot dead in his flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.70,0:22:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,房内门窗皆从内反锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors locked, windows bolted from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.40,0:22:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟凡·库一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly the same as Van Coon.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.60,0:22:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天哪 你是说… - 凶手又得手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- God! You think…? - He's killed another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.80,0:22:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·卢奇 自由职业记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian Lukis, freelance journalist,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.40,0:22:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,在自己家被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}murdered in his flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.20,0:22:41.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,房门从内紧锁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Doors locked from the inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.00,0:22:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得承认 两次很相似\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've got to admit, it's similar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.10,0:22:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,两人都是被能穿水泥墙的凶手杀的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both men killed by someone who can walk through solid walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:46.70,0:22:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,探长 你真认为艾迪·凡·库的死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Inspector, do you seriously believe that Eddie Van Coon was.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.90,0:22:51.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,仅仅是一起都市自杀？\N{\fnArial\fs30}just another city suicide?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.40,0:22:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你该看过弹道检测报告了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have seen the ballistics report, I suppose?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.60,0:22:59.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,杀害他的子弹 是出自他的枪口么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the shot that killed him. Was it fired from his own gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.00,0:22:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.40,0:23:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 所以这案子进程本来\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. So this investigation might move.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.20,0:23:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,会快很多 要是你们当初相信我的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}a bit quicker if you were to take my word as gospel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.20,0:23:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚向你递交了谋杀调查申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've just handed you a murder inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.60,0:23:12.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,请给我五分钟调查死者公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five minutes in his flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.80,0:23:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,四楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four floors up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.00,0:23:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以他们自认为安全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why they think they're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.70,0:23:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,门链搭上 门闩上 就认为固若金汤了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put a chain across the door, bolt it shut, think they're impregnable.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:54.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本没考虑 还有别的方法进入房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't reckon for one second that there's another way in.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.30,0:23:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不懂 - 这是个飞檐走壁的凶手\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't understand. - Dealing with a killer who can climb.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.70,0:24:02.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你到底在干嘛 - 凶手能像昆虫一样攀墙\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing? - Clings to the walls like an insect.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.10,0:24:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他的入口\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he got in.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.20,0:24:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.80,0:24:08.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他沿墙而上 跑过屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He climbed up the side of the walls, ran along the roof,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.70,0:24:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从天窗跳了进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}dropped in through this skylight.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.90,0:24:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧 蜘蛛侠吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not serious?! Like Spider-Man?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.60,0:24:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他爬上了港口住宅区公寓六楼\N{\fnArial\fs30}He scaled six floors of a Docklands apartment building,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.20,0:24:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 从阳台跳进去杀了凡·库 - 鬼扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- jumped the balcony and killed Van Coon. - Oh, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.70,0:24:23.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他也是这么进银行的 沿着窗架攀进露台\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he got into the bank, ran along the window ledge onto the terrace.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:26.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得找到这两个受害人的联系\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to find out what connects these two men.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.10,0:24:57.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,借书卡上敲的日期是他被杀当天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Date stamped on the book is the same day that he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.30,0:25:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.00,0:25:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 杀手到银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, the killer goes to the bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.40,0:25:21.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,留下了威胁密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}leaves a threatening cipher at the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.80,0:25:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,凡·库看到后惊慌失措 跑回自己家锁上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Van Coon panics, returns to his apartment, locks himself in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.20,0:25:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,几小时后 他被杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hours later, he dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.40,0:25:31.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手在图书馆发现了卢奇 把密码写在\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer finds Lukis at the library, he writes the cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:31.50,0:25:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,他一定会看到的书架上\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the shelf where he knows it'll be seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.50,0:25:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢奇逃回家里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lukis goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.10,0:25:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,深夜 同样被杀害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Late that night, he dies too.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.50,0:25:42.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们为什么会被杀 夏洛克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did they die, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.00,0:25:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有密码能告诉我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only the cipher can tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.80,0:25:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,世界全靠编码和密码运转 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world's run on codes and ciphers, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.00,0:25:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,从价值百万的银行报警系统\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the million-pound security system at the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:54.90,0:25:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,到你欺负的条码扫描仪\N{\fnArial\fs30}to the PIN machine you took exception to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.60,0:25:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们身边密码术无处不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cryptography inhabits our every waking moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:58.60,0:26:00.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 我知道 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, OK, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.10,0:26:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是电脑生成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's all computer generated…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.70,0:26:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,电子编译 电子密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}electronic codes, electronic ciphering methods.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.10,0:26:06.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次的不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is different.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.40,0:26:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是古代手法\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an ancient device.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.40,0:26:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现代编译法没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Modern code-breaking methods won't unravel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.40,0:26:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们这是去哪？- 我要去咨询个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where are we headed? - I need to ask some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.60,0:26:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？不好意思再说一遍？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.30,0:26:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听清楚了 我死都不说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You heard me perfectly. I'm not saying it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.30,0:26:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你咨询别人？- 是颜料\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need advice? - On painting.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.10,0:26:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我得问问专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I need to talk to an expert.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.90,0:26:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,新系列的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Part of a new exhibition.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.70,0:26:36.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很有意思 - 我命名它为\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Interesting. - I call it…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.40,0:26:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,城市嗜血狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Urban Bloodlust Frenzy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:39.30,0:26:40.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,朗朗上口\N{\fnArial\fs30}Catchy!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.20,0:26:43.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只有两分钟 社区协警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got two minutes before a Community Support Officer.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.70,0:26:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就要转过那墙角来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}comes around that corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.10,0:26:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我画着 你说？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we do this while I'm working?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.90,0:26:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你知道这谁画的么 - 我认得这颜料\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Know the author? - I recognise the paint.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.10,0:27:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,像密歇根产的 喷力强劲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like Michigan…hard-core propellant.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.00,0:27:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜含锌\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd say zinc.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.00,0:27:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个符号呢 你认识么\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what about the symbols? Do you recognise them?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.30,0:27:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,都不知是不是个符号\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even sure it's a proper language.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.70,0:27:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个人被杀了 莱兹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men have been murdered, Raz.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.40,0:27:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,破解这密码是找到凶手的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deciphering this is the key to finding out who killed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.70,0:27:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是你们唯一的线索？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is all you've got to go on?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.00,0:27:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好像不太够吧 - 你到底帮不帮忙？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's hardly much, is it? - Are you going to help us or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.00,0:27:19.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我帮你问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll ask around.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.00,0:27:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯定有人知道点什么 - 喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somebody must know something about it. - Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.80,0:27:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你他妈的在干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.00,0:27:27.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这画廊是登记保护建筑\N{\fnArial\fs30}This gallery is a listed public building.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.70,0:27:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 等等 不是我画的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Wait, wait. It's not me who painted that.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.60,0:27:31.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是帮着拿一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just holding this for…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.40,0:27:39.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是个狂热分子哈？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bit of an enthusiast, are we?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.70,0:27:46.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她手上有个重要修复项目 才进行到一半\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was right in the middle of an important piece of restoration.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.10,0:27:48.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不可能突然辞职的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would she suddenly resign?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.10,0:27:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,家庭纠纷 她辞呈里说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Family problems. She said so in her letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.00,0:27:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她没家庭啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she doesn't have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.20,0:27:52.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,她独自来这个国家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}She came to this country on her own.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.80,0:27:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安迪 - 那些茶壶 那些陶瓷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Andy! - Look, those teapots, those ceramics.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.50,0:27:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经成了她的心头宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}They've become her obsession.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.70,0:27:59.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都修复它们好几周了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been working on restoring them for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.60,0:28:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信她会突然…抛下它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't believe that she would just…abandon them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.60,0:28:07.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是想躲开某个缠着她的人呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps she was getting a bit of unwanted attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.80,0:28:20.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么这么慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.70,0:28:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你知道的嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you know how it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.60,0:28:27.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拘留所警官都是慢性子 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Custody sergeants don't really like to be hurried, do they?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.40,0:28:29.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,走程序呗 按指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just formalities. Fingerprints,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.90,0:28:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,签罚单 周二我还得上治安法庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}charge sheet, and I've got to be in magistrates' court on Tuesday.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.60,0:28:36.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯？- 我 夏洛克 我周二要上庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Me, Sherlock! In court, on Tuesday!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.60,0:28:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们要判我反社会行为罪 - 可以 很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They're giving me an ASBO! - Good, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:39.60,0:28:40.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你告诉你那小朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell your little pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.50,0:28:42.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎他随时去自首\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's welcome to go and own up any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.40,0:28:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个符号 我还是搞不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}This symbol, I still can't place it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.90,0:28:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要你去趟警察局\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I need you to go to the police station.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:46.40,0:28:47.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,问问那记者的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ask about the journalist.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.90,0:28:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的个人财物应该存档了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The personal effects will have been impounded.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.90,0:28:52.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去把他的日记 或别的什么记录行程的拿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get hold of his diary, or something that will tell us his movements.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.60,0:28:55.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,去找凡·库的助理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go and see Van Coon's PA.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.40,0:28:58.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,追踪他们的行程 总会找到重合的\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you retrace their steps, somewhere they'll coincide.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.90,0:29:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏格兰场\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scotland Yard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.60,0:29:21.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,周五从大连飞回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flew back from Dalian Friday.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.00,0:29:23.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来他跟销售连开了几场会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like he had back-to-back meetings with the sales team.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.50,0:29:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能给我打印一份么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you print me up a copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.50,0:29:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没问题 - 他去世那天呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sure. What - About the day he died?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.30,0:29:28.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我他在哪吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell me where he was?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.60,0:29:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 这有个空当\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I've got a gap.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.80,0:29:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有他所有的收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have all his receipts.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.50,0:29:36.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的朋友… - 听着 不管你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Your friend… - Listen, whatever you say,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.00,0:29:37.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都百分百赞成\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm behind you 100 per cent.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.90,0:29:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是个自大的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}…he's an arrogant sod.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.40,0:29:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就这样而已？别人说得可要难听多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that was mild. People say a lot worse than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.40,0:29:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来要这个的吧 那记者的日记\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is what you wanted, isn't it? The journalist's diary?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.10,0:29:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他做老板如何 阿曼达？欣赏员工么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What kind of a boss was he, Amanda? Appreciative?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.20,0:30:00.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我可不会用这个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, no. That's not a word I'd use.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.90,0:30:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪只欣赏带天价标签的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only things Eddie appreciated had a big price tag.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.50,0:30:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如那瓶护手霜 是他给你买的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like that hand cream. He bought that for you, didn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.60,0:30:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.50,0:30:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他去世那天叫过出租车 18.5镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a taxi from him on the day he died, 18.50.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.31,0:30:20.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是送他去办公室的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would get him to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.03,0:30:20.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是交通高峰 看看时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not rush hour. Check the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:20.94,0:30:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在早上 18镑他能到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mid-morning. 18 would get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.20,0:30:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,最远到… 西区\N{\fnArial\fs30}as far as… … The West End.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.13,0:30:25.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得他说过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember him saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.99,0:30:29.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,地铁票 一点钟在皮卡迪利广场买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Underground, printed at one in Piccadilly.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.44,0:30:31.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他最终是搭地铁回的办公室\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he got a Tube back to the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.12,0:30:34.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要搭出租进城 搭地铁回来呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would he get a taxi into town, and then the Tube back?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.53,0:30:36.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他在送一件重物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he was delivering something heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.76,0:30:39.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,扛着个大包裹上电梯很不方便\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wouldn't lug a package up the escalator.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.26,0:30:40.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,送东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Delivering?!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.31,0:30:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,送给皮卡迪利广场地铁站附近某人\N{\fnArial\fs30}To somewhere near Piccadilly Station.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:42.48,0:30:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,把包裹放下 送到手 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dropped the package, delivered it, and then…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.01,0:30:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,停了一下 他饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stopped on his way. He got peckish.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.76,0:30:56.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是你在去地铁站的路上买了午饭\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you bought your lunch from here en route to the station.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.34,0:30:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是你从哪过来的呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}but where were you headed from?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.66,0:30:59.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从哪下的出租车？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did the taxi drop you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.94,0:31:01.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 对了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oof! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.00,0:31:03.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾迪·凡·库死的那天 送了个包裹来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Van Coon brought a package here the day he died.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.99,0:31:05.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管那箱子里是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever was hidden inside that case…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.41,0:31:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经拼出了一幅拼图\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've managed to piece together a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.78,0:31:09.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,用零碎信息 信用卡账单 收据\N{\fnArial\fs30}using scraps of information, credit card bills, receipts.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.63,0:31:10.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,他从中国回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He flew back from China,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.38,0:31:11.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就来了这里 - 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- then he came here. - Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.74,0:31:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这街上 附近\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in this street, somewhere near.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.35,0:31:14.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知具体在哪 可…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know where, but…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.35,0:31:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就在那儿的那个商店 - 你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That shop, over there. - How could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.05,0:31:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢奇的日记 他那天也在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lukis' diary. He was here too.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.79,0:31:23.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他记下了地址 - 哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He wrote down the address. - Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.65,0:31:48.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.40,0:31:57.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,想要…招财猫吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want…lucky cat?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.67,0:32:00.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不用了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.85,0:32:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要10镑啊 只要10镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}10! 10 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.57,0:32:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得你老婆 她会喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think your wife, she will like.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.85,0:32:09.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.95,0:32:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock…
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.17,0:32:23.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个标签 - 没错 我看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The label there. - Yes, I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.65,0:32:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟密码上一模一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's exactly the same as the cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.63,0:32:34.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是个古老的号码系统 「苏州码子」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's an ancient number system, Hang Zhou.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.20,0:32:37.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,如今只有街头贩子才用\N{\fnArial\fs30}These days only street traders use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.53,0:32:39.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是银行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those were numbers written on the wall at the bank.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.13,0:32:40.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,图书馆墙上写的数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}and at the library.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:40.79,0:32:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,用古老的中国异体字写的数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers written in an ancient Chinese dialect.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.81,0:32:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是15\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.43,0:32:47.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们以为是商标的 其实是数字15\N{\fnArial\fs30}What we thought was the artist's tag, it's a number 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.09,0:32:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,蒙眼布 那条水平线也是数字\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the blindfold, the horizontal line. That was a number as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.62,0:32:53.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,是汉字的1 约翰 我们找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Chinese number one, John. We found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.46,0:33:02.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个从中国回来的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men travel back from China,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.79,0:33:07.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,都直奔招财猫商店而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}both head straight for the Lucky Cat emporium.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.70,0:33:09.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们看到了什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What did they see?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.82,0:33:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不因为他们看到了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not what they saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.17,0:33:14.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,是他们箱子里拿回来的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's what they both brought back in those suitcases.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.29,0:33:17.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说的不是机场免税品吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you don't mean duty free.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.51,0:33:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.48,0:33:25.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想塞巴斯汀说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about what Sebastian told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.86,0:33:28.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,关于凡·库的 他在市场上处于机动状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}About Van Coon, about how he stayed afloat in the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.68,0:33:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 损失五百万 - 一星期又赚回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lost 5 million. - Made it back in a week.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.76,0:33:33.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是他赚钱的窍门\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how he made such easy money.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.93,0:33:36.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个走私者 - 嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He was a smuggler. - Mm.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.44,0:33:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,有完美的掩护\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cover would have been perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.46,0:33:41.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,商人 经常去亚洲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Businessman, making frequent trips to Asia.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.93,0:33:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢奇也是 采写中国新闻的记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lukis was the same, a journalist writing about China.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.78,0:33:47.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们俩都从事走私\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of them smuggled stuff about.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.96,0:33:50.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,招财猫是他们的交货地\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Lucky Cat was their drop-off.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.02,0:33:52.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们为什么会死呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why did they die?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.44,0:33:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,没道理啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.61,0:33:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们来商店 送到了货\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they both turn up at the shop and deliver the goods,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.81,0:33:57.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么有人威胁他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}why would someone threaten them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.42,0:34:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要杀人灭口 他们已经完成任务了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and kill them after the event, after they'd finished the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.57,0:34:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们之一雁过拔毛了呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if one of them was light-fingered?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.10,0:34:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思？- 偷了东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you mean? - Stole something.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.36,0:34:10.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,从那批货里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something from the hoard.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.50,0:34:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,但凶手不知道谁偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The killer doesn't know which of them took it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.16,0:34:14.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 于是威胁他们两个 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- so threatens them both. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.99,0:34:18.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,替我想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.15,0:34:21.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次下雨是什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time that it rained?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.33,0:34:32.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,从周一就在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been here since Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.36,0:34:35.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（姚素琳）
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.86,0:34:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少三天内 没人进过那公寓的门\N{\fnArial\fs30}No-one's been in that flat for at least three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.14,0:34:48.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,可能是度假去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could have gone on holiday.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.90,0:34:52.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你度假去不关窗户吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you leave your windows open when you go on holiday?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.03,0:35:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.12,0:35:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人来过这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone else has been here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:13.72,0:35:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人闯进公寓 打翻了花瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody else broke into the flat and knocked over the vase,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.44,0:35:17.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.48,0:35:30.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次总能先让我进来吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think maybe you could let me in this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.69,0:35:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别老这样行不行？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you not keep doing this, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.31,0:35:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是第一个来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not the first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.91,0:35:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 有人在我之前来过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Somebody's been in here before me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.01,0:35:53.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在说什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.96,0:35:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,八号鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Size eight feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.20,0:36:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,小个子 但…强健灵巧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small, but…athletic.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.26,0:36:05.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真是白费唾沫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm wasting my breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.02,0:36:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,小而有力的手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Small, strong hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.20,0:36:16.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们找到个杂技演员啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our acrobat.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.93,0:36:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走时为什么不关窗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why didn't he close the window when he lef…?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.36,0:36:23.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 真蠢 太蠢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, stupid, stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.42,0:36:24.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是显然的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.43,0:36:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.18,0:36:52.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你随时想要带上我的话…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any time you want to include me…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.25,0:36:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰…\N{\fnArial\fs30}John…
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.64,0:36:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.88,0:36:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 我是夏洛克·福尔摩斯 我总是单枪匹马\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm Sherlock Holmes and I always work alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.50,0:37:02.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为谁也跟不上我出色的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}because no-one else can compete with my massive intellect!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.59,0:37:47.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,牛奶坏了 脏衣服也有味了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The milk's gone off and the washing's started to smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.66,0:37:51.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有人三天前匆忙离开了 - 有人？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Somebody left here in a hurry three days ago. - Somebody?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.57,0:37:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,姚素琳 我们得找到她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soo Lin Yao. We have to find her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.33,0:37:55.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底要怎么找啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How, exactly?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.24,0:37:58.71,Note,0,0,0,0,,（素琳 打电话给我报个平安 安迪）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.35,0:38:00.61,Note,0,0,0,0,,（国家古董博物馆）
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.61,0:38:02.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,从这个开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could start with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.53,0:38:04.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你咳嗽这么厉害 是不是感冒了啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've gone all croaky. Are you getting a cold?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.04,0:38:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.20,0:38:10.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你上次看到她是什么时候？\N{\fnArial\fs30}When was the last time that you saw her?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.50,0:38:13.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天前 就在博物馆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three days ago. Here at the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.03,0:38:16.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天早上他们说 她辞职了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This morning they told me she'd resigned.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.25,0:38:19.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,忽然就走了 工作都没做完\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like that. Left her work unfinished.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.63,0:38:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在这最后一下午 最后一件事是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was the last thing that she did on her final afternoon?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.05,0:38:33.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,为游客做表演 演示茶艺\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does this demonstration for the tourists, a tea ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.72,0:38:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,于是她有可能把东西打包起来先放在这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So she would have packed up her things and just put them in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:57.07,0:38:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找到姚素琳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to get to Soo Lin Yao.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.34,0:39:00.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 如果她还活着的话 - 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If she's still alive. - Sherlock!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.83,0:39:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,哇 瞧瞧这是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, look who it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.59,0:39:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有你可能感兴趣的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found something you'll like.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.94,0:39:12.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,星期二早晨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tuesday morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.90,0:39:14.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要出庭 说包是你的就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}all you've got to do is turn up and say the bag was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.91,0:39:16.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,别管什么出庭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forget about your court date.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.32,0:39:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,伙计 你真牛啊！\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, that was rad!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.24,0:39:28.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏一棵树 最好的地方是森林里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to hide a tree, then a forest is the best place to do it,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.71,0:39:30.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}wouldn't you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.74,0:39:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,人们只会毫不注意地走过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}People would just walk straight past, not knowing,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.17,0:39:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全无法解密你的信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}unable to decipher the message.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.14,0:39:39.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在那儿 我刚才就看见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}There. I spotted it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.23,0:39:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他们来过 - 颜料也一样吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They've been here. - And that's the exact same paint?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.10,0:39:44.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.20,0:39:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 想要破解这个密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, if we're going to decipher this code,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.40,0:39:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们必须找更多证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}we need to look for more evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.87,0:40:52.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,接电话 我打了半天了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Answer your phone. I've been calling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.42,0:40:54.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.20,0:41:10.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,被盖掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's been painted over.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.90,0:41:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不明白 刚才…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. It was…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.41,0:41:17.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.47,0:41:20.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,10分钟前 我还看见的\N{\fnArial\fs30}10 minutes ago. I saw it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.83,0:41:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一大片涂鸦\N{\fnArial\fs30}A whole load of graffiti.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.99,0:41:24.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人不想我看到它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody doesn't want me to see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.56,0:41:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克 - 嘘\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock. - Ssh!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.32,0:41:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干什么？- 约翰 集中精神\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you doing…? - John, concentrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.82,0:41:30.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你非常专心 闭上眼睛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to concentrate. Close your eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.81,0:41:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了？为什么…你要干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why? Why? What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:34.20,0:41:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你将你的图像记忆最大化\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to maximise your visual memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.35,0:41:37.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你看到的描绘出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Try to picture what you saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.88,0:41:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能描绘出来吗？- 能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you picture it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.35,0:41:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能记得吗？- 肯定能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you remember it? - Yes, definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.05,0:41:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你记得图案吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you remember the pattern?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.03,0:41:44.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 记得 - 你能记得多少？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - How much can you remember it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:44.61,0:41:45.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你别急呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.37,0:41:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为一般人类的图像记忆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because the average human memory on visual matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.68,0:41:48.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有62%准确度\N{\fnArial\fs30}is only 62% accurate.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.89,0:41:51.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 别担心 我都记得呢 - 真的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, don't worry, I remember all of it. - Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.48,0:41:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少 让我掏掏口袋就行\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least I would, if I could get to my pockets.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.49,0:41:56.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍照了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I took a photograph.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.71,0:42:18.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,全都是成对的 约翰 瞧这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always in pairs, John, look.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.52,0:42:21.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,数字…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Numbers…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.59,0:42:23.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,和图案搭配\N{\fnArial\fs30}come with partners.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:23.68,0:42:25.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我好困\N{\fnArial\fs30}God, I need to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.20,0:42:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么画在贴轨道的地方？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he paint it so near the tracks?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.11,0:42:28.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:28.22,0:42:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,每天有无数人经过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of people pass by there every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:30.35,0:42:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,哪怕只20分钟…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just 20 minutes…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.27,0:42:34.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.38,0:42:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然了 他要消息 他只是在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, he wants information. He's trying to communicate.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:37.32,0:42:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,与地下世界的朋友通讯\N{\fnArial\fs30}with his people in the underworld.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:38.98,0:42:41.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管被偷的是什么 他想要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever was stolen, he wants it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.12,0:42:44.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在这里 这是个密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's somewhere here, in a code.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.91,0:42:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有姚素林 我们没法破解它\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't crack this without Soo Lin Yao.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.94,0:42:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, good.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.94,0:42:53.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个从中国回来的男人被谋杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two men who travelled back from China were murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.39,0:42:56.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,凶手用苏州码子留下了口信\N{\fnArial\fs30}And their killer left them messages in Hang Zhou numerals.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:56.50,0:42:58.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,姚素林现在很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soo Lin Yao is in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:58.71,0:43:01.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个密码和其他的口信都是同一个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That cipher, it was just the same pattern as the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.34,0:43:03.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想要把她也杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He means to kill her as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.15,0:43:05.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我到处都问过了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I've tried everywhere…
Dialogue: 0,0:43:05.25,0:43:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,朋友 同事 我不知她哪里去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}friends, colleagues. I don't know where she's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.50,0:43:10.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 她可能早在千里之外了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, she could be a thousand miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.69,0:43:12.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you looking at?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.41,0:43:14.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我讲讲那些茶壶吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me more about those teapots.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.22,0:43:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,她对茶壶非常着迷 它们急需修复\N{\fnArial\fs30}The pots were her obsession. They need urgent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:19.27,0:43:22.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果过干 陶土就会开始裂缝\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they dry out, then the clay can start to crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.34,0:43:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,显然 你必须不停地用它泡茶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, you have to just keep making tea in them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:25.47,0:43:28.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,昨天 这些壶里只有一个是有光泽的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yesterday, only one of those pots was shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.21,0:43:30.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在有两个了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, there are two.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.22,0:44:22.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想吃块午茶饼干吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fancy a biscuit with that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.68,0:44:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,几百年的东西了 我可不想打破它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Centuries old. Don't want to break that.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.61,0:44:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:37.77,0:44:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}You saw the cipher.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.28,0:44:42.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你就知道他是冲我来的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you know he is coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:43.09,0:44:45.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,直到现在为止 你躲避他的策略还都很聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been clever to avoid him so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.54,0:44:48.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须完成它\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.92,0:44:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,完成我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}To finish this work.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:52.44,0:44:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,早晚注定的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only a matter of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:54.69,0:44:56.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他总会找到我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know he will find me.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:57.51,0:44:59.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁？你见过他吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is he? Have you met him before?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.76,0:45:05.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我小时候 在中国认识了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I was a girl, we met in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.02,0:45:09.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认出了他的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I recognised his…
Dialogue: 0,0:45:09.82,0:45:11.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 签名 - 那个密码？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Signature. - The cipher?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.87,0:45:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有他会这样 蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only he would do this. Zhi Zhu.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:19.06,0:45:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 蜘蛛？- 中文的蜘蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Zhi Zhu? - The spider.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.06,0:45:28.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认得这个标志吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this mark?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:28.48,0:45:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这是一个堂口的标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. It's the mark of a Tong.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.68,0:45:34.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 古老的黑帮组织\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Huh? - Ancient crime syndicate,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.37,0:45:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,源自中国\N{\fnArial\fs30}based in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.31,0:45:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个喽啰都有这个标志\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every foot soldier bears the mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.49,0:45:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每个为他们运货的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone who hauls for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.51,0:45:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,运货？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hauls?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.13,0:45:50.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说你也做走私？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You mean you were a smuggler?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:54.82,0:45:56.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时我只有15岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 15.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.66,0:46:00.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,父母双亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}My parents were dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.46,0:46:03.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,无依无靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had no livelihood.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:04.75,0:46:07.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,每日无法谋生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way of surviving, day-to-day,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.45,0:46:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有为黑帮大哥工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}except to work for the bosses.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.66,0:46:12.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都是谁？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:12.91,0:46:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们号称黑莲帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are called the Black Lotus.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.49,0:46:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,到了我16岁时\N{\fnArial\fs30}By the time I was 16,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.89,0:46:26.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经把价值几千镑的毒品\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was taking thousands of pounds worth of drugs.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.53,0:46:28.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,带入香港境内了\N{\fnArial\fs30}across the border into Hong Kong.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:32.63,0:46:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我结束了那段生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I managed to leave that life behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.06,0:46:38.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来到了英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came to England.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.96,0:46:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这里 我找到了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}They gave me a job, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:46.12,0:46:50.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都好起来了 全新的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was good. New life.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.40,0:46:52.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后他就来找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he came looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:53.17,0:46:54.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.86,0:46:59.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本希望 在五年之后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hoped, after five years…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.54,0:47:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许他们已经忘了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe they would have forgotten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:03.94,0:47:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他们从不会真正放你走\N{\fnArial\fs30}But they never really let you leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.73,0:47:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们这么小的社群中\N{\fnArial\fs30}A small community like ours…
Dialogue: 0,0:47:12.71,0:47:14.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们其实一直如影随形\N{\fnArial\fs30}…they are never very far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.59,0:47:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来到我的公寓\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came to my flat.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.78,0:47:27.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我帮他找些被偷走的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me to help him to track down something that was stolen.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:27.26,0:47:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你并不知道要找什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've no idea what it was?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.75,0:47:31.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拒绝帮他找\N{\fnArial\fs30}I refused to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.17,0:47:35.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 当年你在中国 与他交情很深咯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you knew him well when you were living back in China?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.79,0:47:39.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.03,0:47:43.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的亲哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:57.43,0:47:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个孤儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two orphans.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.40,0:48:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.10,0:48:07.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么为黑莲帮卖命\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could work for the Black Lotus,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.43,0:48:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么像乞丐一样饿死街头\N{\fnArial\fs30}or starve on the streets, like beggars.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.48,0:48:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我哥哥成了他们的喽啰\N{\fnArial\fs30}My brother has become their puppet.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.98,0:48:22.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在一个姓单的人手下做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the power of the one they call Shan.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.58,0:48:25.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑莲帮的帮主\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Black Lotus general.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.97,0:48:30.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我赶走了哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}I turned my brother away.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.14,0:48:35.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说我背叛了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said I had betrayed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.02,0:48:39.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,第二天 我来上班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next day, I came to work.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.62,0:48:42.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,一眼就看到了那密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the cipher was waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.58,0:48:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能破解吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you decipher these?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:52.45,0:48:55.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都是数字 - 这个我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These are numbers. - Yes, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.81,0:49:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里 穿过人眼的横线 代表中文的数字一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, the line across the man's eyes, it's the Chinese number one.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.40,0:49:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个是个15 但是怎样解码呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this one is 15. But what's the code?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.85,0:49:06.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有的走私者都知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the smugglers know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.41,0:49:08.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是按照一本书…\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's based upon a book…
Dialogue: 0,0:49:14.01,0:49:15.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:16.07,0:49:19.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,蜘蛛找到我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Zhi Zhu has found me.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.56,0:49:22.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别去 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:22.22,0:49:23.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.99,0:49:24.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.99,0:49:27.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,进来 快进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in. Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.58,0:49:45.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得去帮他 我走后锁好门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have to go and help him. Bolt the door after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:17.19,0:50:18.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:50:19.40,0:50:21.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有些头骨已经20多万年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some of those skulls are over 200, 000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:21.81,0:50:23.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托有点敬畏之心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a bit of respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.09,0:50:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:25.72,0:51:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,梁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:29.55,0:51:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,大哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}SPEAKS CHINESE.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:35.06,0:51:36.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}SPEAKS CHINESE.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:43.43,0:51:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:17.45,0:52:18.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,到底要几起凶案发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many murders is it going to take.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:18.63,0:52:21.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才相信一个疯子在到处杀人啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}before you start believing that this maniac's out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.72,0:52:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚一个女孩中枪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young girl was gunned down tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:25.87,0:52:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,三天三个受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's three victims in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:28.32,0:52:29.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该正在满世界找他才对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're supposed to be finding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:29.74,0:52:31.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·卢奇和艾迪·凡·库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Brian Lukis and Eddie Van Coon.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.08,0:52:33.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,为一伙跨国走私者工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}were working for a gang of international smugglers.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.39,0:52:37.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们号称黑莲帮 在伦敦秘密活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}A gang called the Black Lotus, operating here in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.01,0:52:38.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在你鼻子底下作乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}right under your nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:39.74,0:52:41.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有证据吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you prove that?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.25,0:52:50.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想吃什么 猪肉还是意大利面？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you thinking? Pork or pasta?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.21,0:52:51.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是你啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.36,0:52:55.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不需要五星级美食家来决定吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose it's never going to trouble Egon Ronay, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.59,0:52:57.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我推荐意大利面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd stick with the pasta.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:57.35,0:52:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是别吃烤猪排了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't want to be doing roast pork,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:58.36,0:53:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,整天都在解剖尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}not if you're slicing up cadavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.33,0:53:03.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你吃什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you having?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:03.57,0:53:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我工作时不吃饭 消化让我迟钝\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't eat when I'm working. Digesting slows me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.49,0:53:08.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今晚要在这工作？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're working here tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.48,0:53:10.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有些尸体要检查 - 有些？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Need to examine some bodies. - Some?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:10.82,0:53:12.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,布莱恩·卢奇和艾迪·凡·库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Van Coon and Brian Lukis.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.67,0:53:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,都在我名单上呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on my list.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.77,0:53:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,能把他们推出来 再让我看一眼吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could you wheel them out again for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:19.29,0:53:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃…他们的档案已经送审了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…their paperwork's already gone through.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:27.15,0:53:29.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你的头发变了嘛 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You changed your hair. - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.97,0:53:32.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你换了发型 以前都从中间分开的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The style. It's usually parted in the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.78,0:53:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, well…
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.20,0:53:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好看的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.49,0:53:38.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个发型…更适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It…suits you better this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.34,0:53:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只想看一眼脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just interested in the feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.77,0:53:52.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 脚？- 是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The feet? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.04,0:53:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,介不介意我看一眼呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if we have a look at them?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.05,0:54:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 来看凡·库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Van Coon.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:10.02,0:54:12.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! So…
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.60,0:54:14.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,要么这两人碰巧去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So either these two men just happened to visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:14.31,0:54:15.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,同一家中国纹身店\N{\fnArial\fs30}the same Chinese tattoo parlour,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:15.87,0:54:19.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 要么我说的是真的 - 你想怎样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- or I'm telling the truth. - What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:19.07,0:54:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想要卢奇和凡·库两人家所有的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want every book from Lukis' apartment and Van Coon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.35,0:54:23.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,书？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their books?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.44,0:54:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们不只是个犯罪团伙 还是个邪教\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not just a criminal organisation. It's a cult.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.48,0:54:35.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,她哥哥就是被头目之一拉拢的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her brother was corrupted by one of its leaders.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.93,0:54:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,素琳说了那人的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soo Lin said the name.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.45,0:54:40.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 单 单帮主\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Shan. General Shan.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:40.09,0:54:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对他一点线索也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're still no closer to finding him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.51,0:54:44.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,错 我们的信息已经快全了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wrong! We've got almost all we need to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:44.83,0:54:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把我们缺的那几块基本补上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She gave us most of the missing pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.09,0:54:49.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么要去见他妹妹呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he need to visit his sister?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.45,0:54:51.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他为什么需要她的知识？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did he need her expertise?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.08,0:54:51.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在博物馆工作啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}She worked at the museum.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.99,0:54:53.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没错 - 她是古董专家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Exactly. - An expert in antiquities.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:55.71,0:54:57.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 当然 懂了 - 是古董 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Of course, I see. - Valuable antiquities, John.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:57.88,0:55:00.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,珍贵中国文物 在黑市上购买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ancient Chinese relics purchased on the black market.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:00.81,0:55:03.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,毛的革命之后 那里埋藏了无数珍宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}China's home to a thousand treasures hidden after Mao's revolution.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:03.97,0:55:05.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑莲帮正在兜售它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Black Lotus is selling them.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:11.08,0:55:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看日期…这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check for the dates… Here,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:12.93,0:55:15.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 「四天前自中国运进」\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, "arrived from China four days ago".
Dialogue: 0,0:55:16.69,0:55:17.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anonymous.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:18.66,0:55:20.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖方不透露自己的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}The vendor doesn't give his name.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.76,0:55:23.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「两件来自东方 埋藏多年的宝物」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Two undiscovered treasures from the East."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:23.30,0:55:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,一件在卢奇箱子里 另一件在凡·库那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}One in Lukis' suitcase and one in Van Coon's.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:27.21,0:55:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,「古董…」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Antiquities…
Dialogue: 0,0:55:29.45,0:55:32.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,「顺利拍出」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"sold at auction."
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.02,0:55:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧 又有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, here's another one.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:34.79,0:55:36.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个月前自中国运进\N{\fnArial\fs30}Arrived from China a month ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.38,0:55:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国陶瓷雕像 卖了40万镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Chinese ceramic statue sold for 400, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:40.64,0:55:43.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,再看 又一个月前 中国古画50万镑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, a month before that, Chinese painting, 500, 000.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.75,0:55:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有这些 都来自匿名的卖家\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of them from an anonymous source.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.49,0:55:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们正从中国一件件地偷运文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're stealing them back in China.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:47.44,0:55:49.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,卖到英国来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and one by one feeding them into Britain.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:53.42,0:55:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,每次拍卖的日期\N{\fnArial\fs30}Every single auction coincides.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:55.69,0:55:57.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,都和卢奇与凡·库去中国的时间相符\N{\fnArial\fs30}with Lukis or Van Coon travelling to China.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.66,0:55:59.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,那如果他们之一在中国见财起意呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if one of them got greedy when they were in China?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.42,0:56:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们之一偷了东西呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if one of them stole something?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.25,0:56:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是蜘蛛找上门的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why Zhi Zhu's come.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.79,0:56:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我们在为慈善筹款吗 夏洛克？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, are we collecting for charity, Sherlock?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.50,0:56:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.45,0:56:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,门外有个年轻人 搬了几箱子书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A young man's outside with crates of books.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:16.51,0:56:18.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么数字是查询码\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the numbers are references.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.45,0:56:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,查询书的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}To books?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.97,0:56:23.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,以这种方式标明页码 和具体的词\N{\fnArial\fs30}To specific pages and specific words on those pages.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.77,0:56:25.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 那么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, so…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.64,0:56:27.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,15和1 意思是？\N{\fnArial\fs30}15 and 1, that means?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:27.32,0:56:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,15页 第一个词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Turn to page 15 and it's the first word you read.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.52,0:56:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 信息是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, so what's the message?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:30.74,0:56:32.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,要看是哪本书了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends on the book.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.29,0:56:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是图书密码的狡猾之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the cunning of the book code.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.24,0:56:37.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,得是他俩都有的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be one that they both own.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:40.24,0:56:44.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,那好吧 看样子还挺好找的 是吧？\N{\fnArial\fs30}OK, fine. This shouldn't take too long, should it?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:57.66,0:57:01.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们在博物馆找到了这些 是你的笔迹吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found these…at the museum. Is this your writing?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.03,0:57:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们希望素琳能帮我们解码\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, we hoped Soo Lin could decipher it for us.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:05.35,0:57:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.68,0:57:09.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要我做什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anything else I can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:57:10.39,0:57:11.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 还有什么能效劳\N{\fnArial\fs30}To assist you, I mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.85,0:57:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要能安静一会儿 就最好不过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some silence right now would be marvellous.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.05,0:57:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,香烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:59.14,0:58:00.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,想象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:21.20,0:58:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉让你们久等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to keep you waiting,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:23.11,0:58:26.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是医生直到下周四都没有空闲\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we haven't got anything now until next Thursday.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:26.66,0:58:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是慢死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is taking ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.29,0:58:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.79,0:58:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们老这么言而无信 何必预约呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the point of booking an appointment if they can't stick to it?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:34.10,0:58:35.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 怎么了？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, what's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:36.64,0:58:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你雇的那个新医生好久没让病人进去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That new doctor you hired, he hasn't buzzed the intercom for ages.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.50,0:58:43.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去跟他说说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me go and have a word.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.51,0:58:45.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 借过 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me. - Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:47.26,0:58:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:51.69,0:58:52.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.34,0:59:07.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来我已经完事了 我以为我还有病人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like I'm done. I thought I had some more to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.86,0:59:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 哦 我帮你看了一两个 - 一两个？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, I did one or two of yours. - One or two?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.08,0:59:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 也许是五六个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, maybe five or six.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.87,0:59:16.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我真是太不专业了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, that's not very professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.36,0:59:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.26,0:59:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…昨晚熬夜有点晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had…a bit of a late one.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.85,0:59:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:26.51,0:59:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,反正 再见啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.94,0:59:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么…你昨晚为什么熬夜呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}So…what were you doing to keep you up so late?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:32.35,0:59:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我参加了一个…读书活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was attending a sort of book event.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:35.70,0:59:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊 她很喜欢读书吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Oh, she likes books,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.72,0:59:40.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说你女朋友？\N{\fnArial\fs30}does she, your girlfriend?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:40.28,0:59:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 我不是去约会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't a date.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.54,0:59:43.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好 我是说 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good. I mean, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.65,0:59:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今晚也没有约会\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I don't have one tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.54,0:59:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,一本人人都有的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A book that everybody would own.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:00.66,1:00:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,15页 第一行\N{\fnArial\fs30}15, entry 1.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.65,1:00:05.62,Note,0,0,0,0,,（增加）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:08.31,1:00:09.67,Note,0,0,0,0,,（鼻孔）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:12.24,1:00:13.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（我）
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.86,1:00:18.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要新鲜空气 咱们今晚出去转转\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to get some air. We're going out tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.48,1:00:21.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 其实 我有个约会 - 啥？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Actually, I've got a date. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.34,1:00:24.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个彼此喜欢的人 出去一起玩那种？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where two people who like each other go out and have fun?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:24.39,1:00:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是建议我们去呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I was suggesting.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.28,1:00:28.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你说的不是 至少我希望…不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it wasn't. At least, I hope not.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.27,1:00:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你带她去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you taking her?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.40,1:00:31.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,呃 看电影吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Er, cinema.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:31.67,1:00:33.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,没劲 无聊 毫无新意…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dull, boring, predictable…
Dialogue: 0,1:00:34.51,1:00:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,试试这个怎么样？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't you try this?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:36.17,1:00:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,只在伦敦上演一晚哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}In London for one night only.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.04,1:00:42.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢了 但我不是来找你请教约会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, but I don't come to you for dating advice.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:42.73,1:00:45.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,很多年没人带我来看马戏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's years since anyone took me to the circus.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.39,1:00:46.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,是么 好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right, yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:47.41,1:00:51.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个朋友推荐的 我就打电话订了票\N{\fnArial\fs30}A friend recommended it to me and I phoned up.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:51.70,1:00:53.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 是什么剧团啊 世界巡演吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! What are they, a touring company or something?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.83,1:00:55.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我其实也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know much about it.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.36,1:00:58.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想他们可能是从中国来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think they're probably from China.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.51,1:01:02.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想也是 真是太巧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think so, yes. There's a coincidence!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.30,1:01:05.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 多谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's wonderful, thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.60,1:01:07.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 我订了两张今晚的票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, I have two tickets reserved for tonight.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:07.70,1:01:10.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么名字？- 福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And what's the name? - Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:13.10,1:01:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 这个名字订了三张票\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I have three in that name.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.30,1:01:18.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧 我们只订了两张\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so, we only booked two.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:18.70,1:01:21.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我打电话 自己订了一张\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then I phoned back and got one for myself as well.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:22.70,1:01:24.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.50,1:01:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi. - Hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.30,1:01:34.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就不能让我消停一晚上？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't let me have just one night off.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.70,1:01:38.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,黄龙马戏团 在伦敦只演一夜 对上号了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow Dragon Circus, in London for one day. It fits.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.20,1:01:39.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,堂口派了一名杀手来英国\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tong sent an assassin to England…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:39.90,1:01:42.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,假扮成走钢丝的 拜托 夏洛克 正常点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dressed as a tightrope walker. Come on, Sherlock, behave!
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.10,1:01:43.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的凶手会飞檐走壁和攀绳\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're looking for a killer who can climb, who can shin up a rope.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:43.80,1:01:46.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,此等身手还能去哪找？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where else would you find that level of dexterity?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.10,1:01:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,中国出境护照发放很严\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exit visas are scarce in China.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.00,1:01:50.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,得有个好理由才能出国\N{\fnArial\fs30}They need a good reason to get out of that country.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:50.70,1:01:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只需四处查看一下…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I need to do is have a quick look around…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.60,1:01:54.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 你去查吧 我带莎拉去买啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine. You do that, I'll take Sarah for a pint.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.20,1:01:56.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.00,1:01:57.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不巧今晚我还有些别的打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do have a couple of other things on my mind this evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:57.90,1:02:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么打算？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like what?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:00.00,1:02:03.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你开玩笑吧 - 什么这么重要？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are kidding? - What's so important?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.00,1:02:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 我在约会呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, I'm in the middle of a date.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.40,1:02:07.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你居然拉我去抓凶手 我是来…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to chase some killer while I'm trying to…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.10,1:02:08.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.50,1:02:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来和莎拉一起开心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}While I'm trying to get off with Sarah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.10,1:02:13.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 准备好了吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}hey… Ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.40,1:02:14.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.60,1:02:27.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说马戏团 这不是马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said circus. This is not a circus.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.00,1:02:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看观众的规模\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the size of this crowd.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:28.90,1:02:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克 这是…艺术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock, this is…art.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.40,1:02:33.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们白天另有工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not their day job.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.60,1:02:35.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉我忘了 这不是马戏团\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I forgot, they're not a circus,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.30,1:02:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是国际走私黑帮\N{\fnArial\fs30}they're a gang of international smugglers.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:11.10,1:04:13.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,经典的中国逃脱术\N{\fnArial\fs30}Classic Chinese escapology act.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.50,1:04:17.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗯？- 弓弦一触即发\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hm? - The crossbow's on a delicate string.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.10,1:04:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,武士得趁它发射前逃脱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The warrior has to escape his bonds before it fires.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.80,1:04:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她刺破沙袋 沙子流出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}She splits the sandbag, the sand pours out.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.30,1:05:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,渐渐地 秤砣朝碗下落\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gradually, the weight lowers into the bowl.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.40,1:05:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢天谢地 - 老天爷\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank God. - My God!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:14.10,1:06:16.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.50,1:06:21.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,从万里之遥月色笼罩的扬子江汀\N{\fnArial\fs30}From the distant moonlit shores of the Yangtze River,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:21.30,1:06:24.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全心为您呈现\N{\fnArial\fs30}we present, for your pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.50,1:06:28.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,索命中华捕鸟蛛\N{\fnArial\fs30}the deadly Chinese bird spider.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.60,1:06:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到没？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.50,1:07:04.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀 好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, well.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:32.80,1:07:34.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,找到你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:40.40,1:08:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,快 快 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. Come on. Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.60,1:08:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我派了几辆车 会堂的人早跑光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I sent a couple of cars. The old hall is totally deserted.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:46.50,1:08:49.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我在马戏团看到了 我们见过的那个纹身\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I saw the mark at the circus. The tattoo that we saw.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:49.90,1:08:52.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,两具尸体上 那个堂口的记号\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the two bodies, the mark of the Tong.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:52.00,1:08:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,卢奇和凡·库参与了走私行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lukis and Van Coon were part of a smuggling operation.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.90,1:08:57.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一人从中国偷了件珍宝\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them stole something in China. Something valuable.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.50,1:08:58.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,马戏团演员是黑帮派来\N{\fnArial\fs30}The circus performers were gang members…
Dialogue: 0,1:08:58.90,1:09:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 追回它的 - 追回什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sent here to get it back. - Get what back?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:02.80,1:09:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.40,1:09:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们不知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.30,1:09:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,福尔摩斯先生 你说的我都照办了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr Holmes, I've done everything you asked.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:10.50,1:09:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,雷斯垂德似乎很看重你的高见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lestrade, he seems to think your advice is worth something.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.60,1:09:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我下令突击搜查\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gave the order for a raid.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.30,1:09:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托你让我有点东西交差\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please tell me I'll have something to show for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.40,1:09:20.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,除了一大笔加班费用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Other than a massive bill for overtime.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.10,1:09:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,明天他们就回中国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll be back in China by tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.80,1:09:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不达目的他们不会走人\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, they won't leave without what they came for.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.80,1:09:31.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,得找到他们的藏身处\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to find a hideout.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.60,1:09:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个据点\N{\fnArial\fs30}A rendezvous.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.50,1:09:37.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定就在这条信息里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere in this message it must tell us.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.90,1:09:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我还是不打扰你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I think perhaps I should leave you to it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.10,1:09:46.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不必走 留下吧 - 对 你现在走最好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, u don't have to go. Stay. - Yes, it'd be better if u left now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.70,1:09:49.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,他开玩笑的 不介意就请留下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's kidding. Please stay if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.30,1:09:53.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我饿坏了 你们不吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it just me or is anyone else starving?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.50,1:09:55.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.80,1:10:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是你们的工作啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is what you do.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:10.50,1:10:13.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你和约翰 靠解谜过日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and John, you solve puzzles for a living.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:13.60,1:10:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是咨询侦探\N{\fnArial\fs30}Consulting detective.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.10,1:10:24.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些蚯蚓文是什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are these squiggles?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:24.90,1:10:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,是数字 古老的中国异体字\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're numbers. An ancient Chinese dialect.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:28.90,1:10:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这种常识我居然都不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. Well, of course I should have known that.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:37.70,1:10:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我弄了潘趣酒和一碗点心\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done punch and a bowl of nibbles.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.50,1:10:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,赫德森太太 你真是天使\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mrs Hudson, you are a saint.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:43.10,1:10:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是今天周一 我就能去超市了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it was Monday, I'd have been to the supermarket.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.40,1:10:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.40,1:10:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那么这些数字是密码？- 正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So these numbers, it's a cipher? - Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.00,1:10:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,每对数字代表一个词？\N{\fnArial\fs30}And each pair of numbers is a word?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.40,1:11:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you know that?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:01.90,1:11:04.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,有两个词已经破译出来了 在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, two words have already been translated. Here.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.90,1:11:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 约翰 - 嗯？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- John. - Mmm?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.60,1:11:11.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 来看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:12.00,1:11:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,博物馆的素琳 她开始帮我们破译了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soo Lin at the museum, she started to translate the code for us.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.30,1:11:17.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没看见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We didn't see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.60,1:11:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,九百\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine mill.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.50,1:11:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是说百万吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does that mean millions?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.20,1:11:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,九百万镑 干什么的？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine million quid. For what?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:27.30,1:11:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得找到句子的结尾\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need to know the end of this sentence.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.90,1:11:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:29.80,1:11:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,去博物馆 修复室\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the museum, to the restoration room.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.90,1:11:34.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 肯定就在我们眼皮底下 - 什么啊？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We must have been staring right at it. - At what?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.50,1:11:37.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,书 约翰 那本书 破译密码的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The book, John. The book. The key to cracking the cipher.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.20,1:11:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,素琳拿它破译的 我们绕着展厅跑时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Soo Lin used it to do this. Whilst we were running around the gallery,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.00,1:11:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她就开始破译了 肯定还在她桌上\N{\fnArial\fs30}she started to translate the code. It must be on her desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.90,1:11:46.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,出租车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taxi!
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.90,1:11:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]抱歉 借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Entschuldigen Sie, bitte.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.00,1:11:53.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]多谢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ja, danke!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:15.90,1:12:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,人人都会有的书\N{\fnArial\fs30}A book that everybody would own.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.40,1:12:20.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦街道图）
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.90,1:12:23.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]请等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, wait!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:23.40,1:12:24.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitte!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.80,1:12:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]他要干嘛？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was wollt er?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:28.50,1:12:29.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,[德语]喂 你干什么啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, du, was machst du?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:29.80,1:12:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- [德语]马上好 - 书还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Minute! - Gib mir doch mein Buch zuruck!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:35.30,1:12:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 不 显然不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, absolutely.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.50,1:12:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 安静在家待一晚 谨遵「医嘱」\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, a quiet night in is just what the doctor ordered.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:41.90,1:12:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 一般我不介意出去逛逛\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I love to go out of an evening.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.50,1:12:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,和中国黑帮单挑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}and wrestle a few Chinese gangsters generally,
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.40,1:12:49.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 可这也太夸张了 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but a girl can get too much. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.20,1:12:55.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫点外卖吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}shall we get a takeaway?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:55.10,1:12:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.30,1:13:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,第15页 第1条\N{\fnArial\fs30}Page 15, entry 1…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:05.20,1:13:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「死人」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead man.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.30,1:13:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确在威胁要杀他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were threatening to kill them.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.30,1:13:10.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第一个密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the first cipher.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.60,1:13:17.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,9… 0… 15…\N{\fnArial\fs30}9… 0… 15…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:17.70,1:13:19.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯 15页第36\N{\fnArial\fs30}er, 15 and 36.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.80,1:13:22.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,36页第39 第39…\N{\fnArial\fs30}36, 39, 39…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:22.30,1:13:25.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,第39…\N{\fnArial\fs30}39…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:25.80,1:13:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,9…\N{\fnArial\fs30}9…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:30.50,1:13:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,九…百万…的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nine", "mill", "for"…
Dialogue: 0,1:13:44.10,1:13:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哎呀 真快 我下去取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Blimey, that was quick. I'll just pop down.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:47.40,1:13:50.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我摆桌子吗？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want me to lay the table?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:50.50,1:13:53.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 摆出来吃？- 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Um…eat off trays? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:55.10,1:13:57.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,70页第35…\N{\fnArial\fs30}70…35…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:00.80,1:14:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,玉…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jade…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:06.40,1:14:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉久等了 多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to keep you. How much do you want?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.90,1:14:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在你这吗？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have it? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.30,1:14:13.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝在你这吗？- 我不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have the treasure? - I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:27.40,1:14:31.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,九百万的玉簪\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Nine mill for Jade pin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.70,1:14:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,龙穴 黑色…\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Dragon den, black…
Dialogue: 0,1:14:35.20,1:14:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,电车道\N{\fnArial\fs30}"tramway."
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.00,1:14:48.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,约翰 约翰 我懂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John! John, I've got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.70,1:14:52.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码 书 是他们的伦敦街道图…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The cipher, the book. It's the London A-Z that they're us…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:08.80,1:15:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,「书富如入海」\N{\fnArial\fs30}A book is like a magic garden,
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.80,1:15:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,「百货皆有」\N{\fnArial\fs30}carried in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:29.40,1:15:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 中国谚语 福尔摩斯先生 - 我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Chinese proverb, Mr Holmes. - I'm…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:34.00,1:15:35.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:35.70,1:15:39.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,真不好意思 光说没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me if I do not take your word for it.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:44.90,1:15:46.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,信用卡 名字是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Debit card, name of…
Dialogue: 0,1:15:46.50,1:15:47.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}S Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:47.80,1:15:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,用我的卡吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take my card.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.90,1:15:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这不是我的 是他借我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, that's not actually mine. He lent that to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:52.30,1:15:58.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,一张5000镑支票 开给夏洛克·福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a cheque for 5, 000 made out in the name of Mr Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.00,1:16:01.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 他让我保管的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he gave me that to look after.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:01.50,1:16:05.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从剧院领的票 购买者也是福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tickets from the theatre collected by you, name of Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:05.80,1:16:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:06.50,1:16:08.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,名字呢？还是福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the name? Er, Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:08.10,1:16:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是容易误会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I realise what this looks like.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:10.20,1:16:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,可我不是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm not him.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.60,1:16:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们听你亲口说过 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We heard it from your own mouth. - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.40,1:16:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我是夏洛克·福尔摩斯 我总是单枪匹马」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"I am Sherlock Holmes and I always work alone."
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.20,1:16:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为谁也跟不上我出色的头脑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because no-one else can compete with my massive intellect.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:23.20,1:16:25.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真这么说过？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did I really say that?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:27.80,1:16:30.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,估计我说那是学他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I suppose there's no use me trying to persuade you.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:30.20,1:16:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was doing an impression.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:34.70,1:16:36.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我姓单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Shan.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:38.10,1:16:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你…你就是单？\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're… You're Shan?
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.10,1:16:44.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们三次试图杀你和你同伴 福尔摩斯先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three times we tried to kill you and your companion, Mr Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.50,1:16:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个杀手杀人都不利落 说明什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does it tell you when an assassin cannot shoot straight?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:02.60,1:17:06.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,说明他们根本没想杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It tells you that they're not really trying.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.20,1:17:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,电车道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tramway.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.70,1:17:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这次不是空包弹了 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not blank bullets now. - OK.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:34.20,1:17:38.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,若我们想杀你 福尔摩斯先生 你已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we wanted to kill you, Mr Holmes, we would have done it by now.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:38.00,1:17:41.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们只是想引蛇出洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just wanted to make you inquisitive.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.80,1:17:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在你那吗？- 什么东西？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you have it? - Do I have what?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:46.00,1:17:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 宝贝 - 我不懂你们说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The treasure. - I don't know what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:49.50,1:17:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我可得验一验\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would prefer to make certain.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.10,1:18:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的命也有价码 信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the price for her life, information.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:28.90,1:18:31.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 簪子在哪？- 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's the hairpin? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.80,1:18:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,皇后的簪子 值900万镑的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Empress pin valued at 900 million sterling?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:35.20,1:18:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经找到买主了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We already had a buyer in the West.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:37.30,1:18:39.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一个人见财起意 私吞了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then one of our people was greedy, he took it,
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.80,1:18:43.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,带回了伦敦 而你 福尔摩斯先生 一直在找\N{\fnArial\fs30}brought it back to London, and you, Mr Holmes, have been searching.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:43.20,1:18:46.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你 求你听我说 我不是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, please. Listen to me. I'm not…
Dialogue: 0,1:18:46.60,1:18:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是夏洛克·福尔摩斯 你一定要相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Sherlock Holmes. You have to believe me.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.50,1:18:51.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没找到你们要的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't found whatever it is you're looking for.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.60,1:18:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我想请一位观众来参与 - 不要 求求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I need a volunteer from the audience. - No, please, please!
Dialogue: 0,1:18:55.50,1:18:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊 谢谢 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, thank you, lady.
Dialogue: 0,1:18:58.30,1:19:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 你非常合适\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you'll do very nicely.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.50,1:19:30.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,女士们先生们 万里之遥月色笼罩的伦敦西一区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ladies and gentlemen, from the distant, moonlit shores of NW1,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:30.80,1:19:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们全心为您献上\N{\fnArial\fs30}we present for your pleasure,
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.80,1:19:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 夏洛克·福尔摩斯的伙伴死里逃生 - 求你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sherlock Holmes' pretty companion in a death-defying act. - Please!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:44.10,1:19:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都看过演出了 一定觉得无聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've seen the act before. How dull for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:48.50,1:19:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,提前知道结果了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how it ends.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.20,1:19:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not Sherlock Holmes!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:51.80,1:19:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:53.60,1:19:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你应该信的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should, you know.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:55.80,1:19:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,夏洛克·福尔摩斯和他截然不同\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sherlock Holmes is nothing at all like him.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.20,1:20:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会怎么描述我 约翰？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How would you describe me, John?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.20,1:20:05.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 机智 活力 神秘？- 迟到？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Resourceful? Dynamic? Enigmatic? - Late?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:05.40,1:20:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,枪是半自动的 一旦发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a semi-automatic. If you fire it,
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.20,1:20:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,子弹会以每秒千米的速度射出\N{\fnArial\fs30}the bullet will travel at over 1, 000 metres per second.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.10,1:20:11.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以呢？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.80,1:20:12.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.50,1:20:15.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,这条隧道半径将近四米\N{\fnArial\fs30}…the radius curvature of these walls is nearly four metres.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.70,1:20:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,走火了 子弹会反弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you miss, the bullet will ricochet.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.80,1:20:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都可能中弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Could hit anyone.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.20,1:20:22.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,还可能弹回墙壁 打中你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}Might even bounce off the tunnel and hit you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:42.80,1:21:44.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.50,1:21:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了 全结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're going to be all right. It's over now.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.70,1:21:56.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,别害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:57.10,1:21:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,下次约会不会这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Next date won't be like this.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.90,1:22:15.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先撤了 不必在报告里提我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll just slip off. No need to mention us in your report.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.30,1:22:18.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 福尔摩斯先生 - 我很看好你 探长\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mr Holmes… - I have high hopes for you, Inspector.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:18.30,1:22:20.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你前途光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}A glittering career.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:20.90,1:22:22.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我唯首是瞻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I go where you point me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:24.70,1:22:26.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,正是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:36.10,1:22:37.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这么说 九百万 百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, nine million. Million.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.10,1:22:42.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,百万 对 「九百万的玉簪 龙穴 黑色电车道」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Million, yes. Nine million for Jade pin dragon den black tramway.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:42.80,1:22:45.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,给全伦敦同伙的指示\N{\fnArial\fs30}An instruction to all their London operatives.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.10,1:22:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一条信息 他们在找的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}A message. What they were trying to reclaim.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.50,1:22:49.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 一支玉簪？- 值九百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What, a jade pin? - Worth nine million.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.50,1:22:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,带去电车道 他们的伦敦据点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring it to the Tramway, their London hideout.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.30,1:22:54.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 一支玉簪值九百万？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hang on. A hairpin worth nine million?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.90,1:22:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 显然是 - 怎么这么贵？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Apparently. - Why so much?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.90,1:22:58.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,这取决于谁戴过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Depends who owned it.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:04.90,1:23:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,两个伦敦分舵的成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two operatives based in London.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:07.00,1:23:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去大连走私花瓶\N{\fnArial\fs30}They travel over to Dalian to smuggle those vases.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.60,1:23:13.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个藏了点私 一支小玉簪\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them helps himself to something, a little hairpin.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:13.00,1:23:15.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 值九百万镑 - 艾迪·凡·库干的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Worth nine million. - Eddie Van Coon was the thief,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:15.60,1:23:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在中国时偷的宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}he stole the treasure when he was in China.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:17.60,1:23:19.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么知道是凡·库 不是卢奇？\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you know it was Van Coon, not Lukis?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:19.30,1:23:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 连杀手都不知道 - 因为皂液\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Even the killer didn't know that. - Because of the soap.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:34.70,1:23:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我是阿曼达 - 他给你带了件礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Amanda? - He brought you a present.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:36.90,1:23:38.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:38.60,1:23:41.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,从中国带回来的小礼物\N{\fnArial\fs30}A little gift when he came back from China.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:41.40,1:23:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你怎么知道？- 你不止是他的助理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How do you know that? - You weren't just his PA, were you?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:45.70,1:23:47.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人嚼舌根了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Someone's been gossiping.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.00,1:23:48.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 那我就不明白…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Then I don't understand why…
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.90,1:23:51.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他家里的洗手香皂液\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scented hand soap in his apartment.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.00,1:23:55.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,300毫升装 快见底了\N{\fnArial\fs30}300ml of it. Bottle almost finished.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.50,1:23:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎样？- 我不觉得艾迪·凡·库像\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sorry…? - I don't think Eddie Van Co.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.70,1:23:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,是会买洗手液的男人\N{\fnArial\fs30}was the type of chap to buy himself hand soap,
Dialogue: 0,1:23:58.50,1:24:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非他常有女客上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}not unless he had a lady coming over.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:01.20,1:24:04.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且和你桌上的护手霜一个牌子\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's the same brand as that hand cream there on your desk.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:06.30,1:24:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们不是认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, it wasn't serious between us.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.90,1:24:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,露水姻缘罢了 不可能长久 他是我老板\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was over in a flash, it couldn't last. He was my boss.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:14.20,1:24:17.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事 你为什么要分手？\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened? Why did you end it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:19.50,1:24:22.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得他不珍惜我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought he didn't appreciate me.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:22.20,1:24:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对我毫不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took me for granted.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:25.50,1:24:27.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,总是放我鸽子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stood me up once too often.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:27.30,1:24:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,说好一起度周末的 他突然就走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd plan to go away for the weekend, and then he'd just leave.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:31.10,1:24:33.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,打个招呼就飞去中国了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fly off to China at a moment's notice.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:33.50,1:24:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后从国外带了礼物向你道歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he brought you a present from abroad to say sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:37.40,1:24:41.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I just have a look at it?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:42.30,1:24:45.10,Note,0,0,0,0,,（两万英镑）
Dialogue: 0,1:24:46.70,1:24:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真的爬上了阳台？\N{\fnArial\fs30}He really climbed up onto the balcony?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.50,1:24:52.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,窗户上钉个木条 你就高枕无忧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nail a plank across the window and all your problems are over.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:55.30,1:24:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.40,1:24:59.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说在街头市场买的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he bought it in a street market.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.70,1:25:02.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不相信 我觉得他是偷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I don't think that's true. I think he pinched it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:03.40,1:25:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 艾迪做得出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's Eddie.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.40,1:25:06.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不知道它值钱 只觉得适合你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't know its value, just thought it would suit you.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.90,1:25:10.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,哦 值多少钱？\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh? What's it worth?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.50,1:25:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,九百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine million.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:17.30,1:25:19.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.10,1:25:20.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:22.20,1:25:24.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,九百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine million?!
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.90,1:25:38.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千年前的文物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Over 1, 000 years old.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:38.50,1:25:40.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,天天放在她床头\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's sitting on her bedside table every night.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:40.80,1:25:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不知道它的价值 不知道为何被追杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't know its value. Didn't know why they were chasing him.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:45.30,1:25:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,早知如此 该买个招财猫给她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Should've just got her a lucky cat.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:51.40,1:25:54.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你很介意 对吧 - 什么？\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You mind, don't you? - What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:54.80,1:25:57.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,单帮主 让她逃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That she escaped. General Shan.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.10,1:25:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓住了她两个打手并不够\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not enough that we got her two henchmen.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:59.40,1:26:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,肯定是个庞大的组织 约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Must be a vast network, John.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.00,1:26:03.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,几千名成员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thousands of operatives.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:03.10,1:26:05.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我两人 不过触及了皮毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I, we barely scratched the surface.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:05.60,1:26:07.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,密码你还是破译了 夏洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cracked the code though, Sherlock.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:07.60,1:26:10.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许迪莫克拿着它 能把他们一网打尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe Dimmock can track down all of them now he knows it.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.40,1:26:15.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 我破译了这一个密码\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, I crack this code,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:15.10,1:26:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,走私者只需重新选一本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the smugglers have to do is pick up another book.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:44.20,1:26:47.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without you…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:47.40,1:26:50.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有你帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}without your assistance,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:50.20,1:26:54.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会有路子来伦敦\N{\fnArial\fs30}we would not have found passage into London.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:56.50,1:26:58.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.04,1:27:05.92,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫：感激没有意义 你不过想我继续庇护罢了）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:09.90,1:27:12.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没料到…\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did not anticipate…
Dialogue: 0,1:27:13.40,1:27:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,半路杀出个程咬金\N{\fnArial\fs30}We did not know this man would come.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.20,1:27:21.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个夏洛克·福尔摩斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Sherlock Holmes.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.20,1:27:28.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你的安全受到威胁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now your safety is compromised.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:29.40,1:27:36.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫：他们追踪不到我身上）
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.50,1:27:40.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不会泄露你的身份的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will not reveal your identity.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.80,1:27:46.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（莫：我十分肯定）
